---
source: crates/mailer/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "format!(\"subject: {}\\n\\n--- text ---\\n{}\\n--- html ---\\n{}\", rendered.subject,\nrendered.text_body, rendered.html_body)"
---
subject: Your Detag email change was requested

--- text ---
Hi,

Someone requested an email-address change on your Detag account. A verification link was sent to the new address — your account still uses this address until that link is opened.

If this was not you, sign in and change your password right away. Your password still works, and nothing about your account has changed yet.

— The Detag team

--- html ---
<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f6f6;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f6f6f6;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;margin:24px 0;padding:32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>Hi,</p>
                <p>Someone requested an email-address change on your Detag account. A verification link was sent to the new address — your account still uses this address until that link is opened.</p>
                <p>If this was not you, sign in and change your password right away. Your password still works, and nothing about your account has changed yet.</p>
                <p>— The Detag team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
